Upstream-Name: raylib DOOM
Upstream-Contact: Raydelto Hernandez <raydelto@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/raydelto/raylib_DOOM
Files-Excluded:
 android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
 debian
 ipx
 sersrc
 sndserv
Comment:
 The upstream tarball is repacked: the Gradle wrapper JAR is a prebuilt
 binary without its source, and ipx/, sersrc/ and sndserv/ are DOS
 network drivers and the old Linux sound server from the 1997 release,
 which are not built. The upstream debian/ directory is replaced by
 this one.
 .
 No game data (IWAD) is included.

